      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.clickUp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [960, 120],
      "notes": "Core-model step 5 (ADR-027/ADR-026): posts the agent output as a ClickUp comment (DRAFT), assigned to the reviewer to notify them. Never finalizes (no status / [AI] Finalny field). Deterministic node, capability not LLM-exposed. onError=continueErrorOutput -> WARN; run still returns.",
